# The Horde mage robe at 15: Report to Anastasia (1959), Investigate the
# Alchemist Shop (1960), Gathering Materials (1961) and Spellfire Robes (1962).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# the coffers behind Anastasia, the Rift Spawn in the Apothecarium and the
# Dalaran mages at Ambermill (the Ambermill Strongbox marks the town);
# Forever's Mage class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/, all four unchanged) and
# quest data (quests 1959, 1960, 1961 and 1962,
# checked 2026-10-14) for the races, givers and the reward (Lesser Spellfire
# Robes); the quest texts for the Apothecarium and the tailor's shop; the KB
# drops table for the Dalaran Mana Gem (80% from every Dalaran apprentice,
# mage, protector, warder, conjuror, watcher and wizard); data/local/mechanics
# (quest-steps and quest-notes, checked 2026-10-20) for the up-to-four Rift
# Spawns, pulling one over the bridge, the half-bridge limit on the coffer,
# the 5 minute table respawn and the Dalaran mobs' levels and spells.
# Forever's quest data lists Orc, Undead and Troll mages for 1959-1961;
# corrections.json adds Orcs to 1959 and 1960, which the merged data left out.
# Spellfire Robes (1962) is offered by Josef Gregorian right after Gathering
# Materials: players' recordings (2 people) and EG Link live both show him
# offering it; the merged data named only Rhiannon Davis, who never did
# (forever-db/corrections/quests.json). It is Undead and Troll in
# quests.json; Forever's quest page names Orcs too (check.py quest 1962: page=Orc/Undead/Troll;
# corrections-private sets it).
# Investigate the Alchemist Shop needs Report
# to Anastasia first (quests.json): Cain Firesong in Brill, Uthel'nay in
# Orgrimmar, Thurston Xane in Thunder Bluff and Un'Thuwa in Sen'jin give it.
# Not in a leveling guide: the Horde routes pass the Undercity and Silverpine
# at these levels only on some starts, and the chain needs two Undercity visits.

step Uthel'nay (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Uthel'nay is one of Orgrimmar's mage trainers, in Darkbriar Lodge in the Valley of Spirits. Then take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades from the tower outside Orgrimmar's main gate.
  level 15
  accept 1959 npc 7311                        -- Uthel'nay

step Cain Firesong (Brill)
  only Undead
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Cain Firesong is the Brill mage trainer, upstairs in the Gallows' End Tavern: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  level 15
  accept 1959 npc 2128                        -- Cain Firesong

step Anastasia Hartwell
  zone Undercity
  tip Anastasia Hartwell stands in the Magic Quarter. The Chest of Containment Coffers and the Cantation of Manifestation lie on the ledge behind her (both come back 5 minutes after someone takes them). You hand both in at the end, so keep them.
  turnin 1959                                 -- Anastasia Hartwell
  accept 1960
  collect 7247 quest 1960.2                   -- Chest of Containment Coffers
  collect 7308 quest 1960.3                   -- Cantation of Manifestation

step The alchemist shop
  tip Algernon's alchemist shop is in the Apothecarium. Stand on the steps or the bridge outside the shop and read the Cantation of Manifestation: up to four invisible Rift Spawns (level 16-17) appear and attack at once, and the city guards do not help. Hit one with a single-target spell and back off over the bridge: the others give up and fade, the one you hit follows. Beat it down on the shop's half of the bridge (past halfway the coffer will not work on it) until it stops fighting and sits stunned under a spiral, use the Chest of Containment Coffers on it, then click the Filled Containment Coffer once it appears on the floor (clicking too early wastes a charge). Three are needed.
  use 7308 optional @53.2,74.5                -- Cantation of Manifestation
  kill 6492 optional                          -- Rift Spawn, down to the stun
  use 7247 optional @53.2,74.5                -- Chest of Containment Coffers, on the stunned Rift Spawn
  collect 7292 x3 quest 1960.1 @53.2,74.5     -- Filled Containment Coffer

step Back to Anastasia Hartwell
  turnin 1960                                 -- Anastasia Hartwell
  accept 1961

step Ambermill
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Leave the Undercity and follow the road south through Silverpine Forest. Every Dalaran human drops a Dalaran Mana Gem four times in five, and Linen Cloth too: the easiest are the Dalaran Apprentices (level 13-14, Frostbolt) on the hills south-east of the Sepulcher, either side of the road south; deeper in, the walled town of Ambermill in south-east Silverpine has Watchers (18-19, Fire Shield and Flamestrike) and Wizards (19-20, Frost Nova) that come back every 4 1/2 minutes and run for help at low health, so pull at the edge. Ten Linen Cloth also come from any humanoid or the Undercity Auction House.
  collect 7293 x6 quest 1961.2                -- Dalaran Mana Gem
  collect 2589 x10 quest 1961.1               -- Linen Cloth

step Josef Gregorian
  zone Undercity
  tip Back to the Undercity. Josef Gregorian, Victor Ward and Rhiannon Davis keep the tailor's shop in the Magic Quarter. Hand the gems and cloth to Josef and let the three of them talk for a moment; then Josef offers Spellfire Robes: take it and hand it straight back to him for the robe.
  turnin 1961                                 -- Josef Gregorian
  accept 1962 npc 4576                        -- Josef Gregorian
  turnin 1962                                 -- Lesser Spellfire Robes
